     "\r\n  \r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div>\r\n    For issues installing anything based or depending on gcc/gfortran\r\n    under OS/X, the following thread might be helpful -- it refers to\r\n    installing RMark, but you should be able to suss out the issues. The\r\n    errors you&#39;re seeing have largely to do with gfortran and related\r\n    things not being installed. Xcode alone is not sufficient. I haven&#39;t\r\n    confirmed this will all work for unmarked but I suspect it might:<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f=21&amp;t=3233&amp;sid=6acddb653ad60521d5c15a5c07d89767&amp;start=10#p14299\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f%3D21%26t%3D3233%26sid%3D6acddb653ad60521d5c15a5c07d89767%26start%3D10%23p14299&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449384276000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Cj1oQQEc8iSxu_DWz-Om2\">http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f=21&amp;t=3233&amp;sid=6acddb653ad60521d5c15a5c07d89767&amp;start=10#p14299</a><br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <div>On 6/10/2022 9:13 PM,\r\n      <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a> wrote:<br>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      \r\n      <div style=\"border:1px solid #d3d3d3;max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000\">\r\n        <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:10px 20px\">\r\n          <table style=\"width:100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n            <tbody>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td style=\"width:70%\"> <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:#333333\"> <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/unmarked/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:#333333\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/unmarked/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449384276000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2XAIUaEpgT8y9dP6i3jlS3\"> unma...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n                  </span> </td>\r\n                <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\"> <span style=\"font:20px/24px arial\"><a style=\"color:#dd4b39;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449384276000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YU8B_EqLBXwjhH655DBPy\">Google\r\n                      Groups</a></span> </td>\r\n                <td style=\"width:32px\"> <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449384276000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YU8B_EqLBXwjhH655DBPy\"><img style=\"border:0;vertical-align:middle\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/4SGWHe9midrWMDxDIJMQraTMMgnAU71soPZ0D28IOSZcs66TdyRoCqyIhaTt-kwo0YKv2lRo05RkwsGFZdnFhdvy60XdxNlL2U-B=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.google.com/images/icons/product/groups-32.png\"></a> </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n          </table>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div style=\"padding:20px;background-color:#f5f5f5\">\r\n          <div style=\"font-family:arial;color:#222222;padding:0px\">\r\n            <a name=\"m_7140674415094795607_digest_top\" style=\"font-size:21px\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Topic digest </a><br>\r\n            <span style=\"font-size:11px\"> <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/unmarked/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-safer