ont-size:15px\"> Amber\r\n                    <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">&lt;amber...@googlemail.com&gt;</a>: Jun 10 11:56AM\r\n                    -0700 </span> <br>\r\n                  <br>\r\n                  Hi Carla, <br>\r\n                   <br>\r\n                  I&#39;m having this same issue installing on a Mac (even\r\n                  with Xcode installed), <br>\r\n                  so I&#39;m wondering if you found a solution to this? <br>\r\n                   <br>\r\n                  I get the same error message as you:<br>\r\n                  ld: warning: directory not found for option <br>\r\n&#39;-L/usr/local/gfortran/lib/gcc/x86_64-apple-darwin18/8.2.0&#39;<br>\r\n                  ld: warning: directory not found for option\r\n                  &#39;-L/usr/local/gfortran/lib&#39;<br>\r\n                  ld: library not found for -lgfortran<br>\r\n                  clang: error: linker command failed with exit code 1\r\n                  (use -v to see <br>\r\n                  invocation)<br>\r\n                  make: *** [unmarked.so] Error 1<br>\r\n                  ERROR: compilation failed for package ‘unmarked’<br>\r\n                  * removing <br>\r\n‘/Library/Frameworks/R.framework/Versions/4.1/Resources/library/unmarked’<br>\r\n                  * restoring previous <br>\r\n‘/Library/Frameworks/R.framework/Versions/4.1/Resources/library/unmarked’<br>\r\n                  Warning message:<br>\r\n                  In i.p(...) :<br>\r\n                  installation of package <br>\r\n‘/var/folders/1z/dqk6_mcs521fs8xhgtz965c40000gn/T//RtmpORiOER/file91273aa12e39/unmarked_1.2.5.tar.gz’\r\n                  <br>\r\n                  had non-zero exit status<br>\r\n                   <br>\r\n                  Very best,<br>\r\n                  Amber<br>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n          </table>\r\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\"> <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_7140674415094795607_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <a name=\"m_7140674415094795607_group_thread_1\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n          <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/t/6424abb93a055ee1?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/t/6424abb93a055ee1?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449384276000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0N67hsCMH5Y7MkJ7NmDW7d\"> Optimal\r\n              detection history length for camera trap studies </a> </div>\r\n          <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n            <tbody>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\"> <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">&quot;ellery...@gmail.com&quot;</a>\r\n                    <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">&lt;ellery...@gmail.com&gt;</a>: Jun 10 11:01AM -0700\r\n                  </span> <br>\r\n                  <br>\r\n                  Excellent, thanks for your thoughts and sharing those\r\n                  papers. <br>\r\n                   <br>\r\n                  Regards,<br>\r\n                  Ellery<br>\r\n                   <br>\r\n                  On Thursday, June 9, 2022 at 12:33:30 PM UTC-5 John C\r\n                  wrote:<br>\r\n                   <br>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n          </table>\r\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\"> <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" hr